# Weather data updates -- runs every hour
# Fetches latest weather data from API and updates the local cache
#
# Format: minute hour day month weekday user command
#
# Last modified: 2026-01-15 by admin
# Changed from every 30 min to every hour to reduce API costs

60 * * * * weather /opt/weather-bot/fetch-weather.sh >> /var/log/weather-bot/weather.log 2>&1
